[00:12.76]1. In preaching the Kingdom and teaching the truth,
[00:18.26]Our Lord showed us how to proceed:
[00:24.96]‘Search out those deserving and ready to hear,
[00:30.72]Those aware of their spiritual need.
[00:37.34]By greeting the household and wishing it peace,
[00:43.00]Then it may be that peace you’ll impart.
[00:50.20]But when they refuse you or turn you away,
[00:55.32]Shake the dust from your feet and depart.’
[01:05.18]2. All those who receive you receive him as well,
[01:11.34]Respond when their heart opens wide.
[01:17.28]Their right disposition for unending life
[01:23.12]Will impel them to serve at your side.
[01:29.85]And never be anxious about what to say,
[01:35.43]For Jehovah will help you to speak.
[01:42.52]Your answer when gracious and seasoned with salt
[01:48.52]Will appeal to the humble and meek.